# Line endings, settled.
#
# The repository's working tree is CRLF and core.autocrlf is unset, so git
# reports a whole-file diff on any file that arrives with LF terminators -
# every line looks changed when nothing has. Without this file, tooling that
# writes from a Linux environment makes the verified tier look rewritten.
#
# Text is normalized to LF in the object store and checked out per platform.
* text=auto

# Formats where the terminator is part of the contract or the payload.
*.xml    text eol=lf
*.xsd    text eol=lf
*.json   text eol=lf
*.jsonld text eol=lf
*.ttl    text eol=lf
*.py     text eol=lf
*.sh     text eol=lf
*.md     text eol=lf
*.html   text eol=lf
*.csv    text eol=lf

# Binary, never touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
